       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. XMLGEN.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 CUSTOMER.
          05 CUST-ID    PIC 9(4) VALUE 42.
          05 CUST-NAME  PIC X(10) VALUE "Ada".
       01 XML-OUT       PIC X(200).
       01 XML-LEN       PIC 9(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           XML GENERATE XML-OUT FROM CUSTOMER COUNT IN XML-LEN.
           DISPLAY XML-OUT(1:XML-LEN).
           STOP RUN.
